      "content": "I see what you mean. It's interesting that you immediately grouped Marcus and Andre into the crime genre. When you look at the descriptions, do you think their backgrounds or specific traits (like Marcus's \"rough exterior\" or Andre's \"street-smart\" nature) automatically pull them toward that gritty setting, or is it just a matter of where their stories might most naturally unfold? I'm trying to figure out if I'm making these assumptions based on their identities or just the silhouettes I've written.",
